<p>
[https://github.com/bitwikiorg Github]
</p>

<!-- ====== UNIFIED SYSTEM FLOW ====== -->
<div style="border:1px solid #8e44ad; background:#fdf6ff; border-radius:12px; padding:14px; margin:24px 0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
<h2 style="color:#8e44ad; margin-top:0;">Unified System Flow</h2>
<p>User → Workspace/PM Agent → BIThub → Core/Node → n8n → BITwiki → BIThub</p>
<p>This loop forms the operational foundation of BITCORE, enabling continuous knowledge expansion and system recursion.</p>
</div>

